<title>QATAR: Algerian president arrives in Qatar.</title>
<headline>Algerian president arrives in Qatar.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian President Liamine Zeroual arrived in Doha on Wednesday for talks with Qatar's emir Sheikh Hamad bin Khalifa al-Thani, the official news agency QNA said.</p>
<p>He is accompanied by six ministers, including those handling foreign affairs, higher education, research, health and trade.</p>
